  displayName: Imp
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1150e54b130d6a844901adb4687ca851, type: 3}
  description: Imps are tiny demons, roughly child-sized or smaller, with sharp features,
    a thin tail, and two small, leathery wings sprouting from their backs. They flit
    and hover constantly, darting just out of reach with quick, agile movement both
    on the ground and in the air. Their voices are high, mocking speech, full of
    giggles, taunts, and whispered bargains.
